   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Doing alright, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.9,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I want to see the sunrise this weekend. Never done it on purpose.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.2,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Lovely idea. Check the sunrise time for Saturday, then pick a spot with a clear view to the east, like a hill or the coast.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 1.07,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "How early do I need to be there?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 1.13,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "About half an hour before. The sky starts glowing well before the sun actually appears.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Wait a second, coffee?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_16",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Definitely, in a flask. Bring a warm layer too, dawn is often the coldest part of the day.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.42,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And afterwards? I'll",
